# Backend: publica discovery/comandos e consome telemetria/ACK.
user aethersense-server
topic readwrite aethersense/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#

# Home Assistant local. A TUI pode omitir este usuário quando o HA usa outro
# broker e deve gerar uma senha própria quando ele for habilitado.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite aethersense/#

# Cada ESP usa o próprio device_id como username. `%u` impede acesso cruzado.
pattern read aethersense/devices/%u/command
pattern write aethersense/devices/%u/ack
pattern write aethersense/devices/%u/event
pattern write aethersense/devices/%u/state
pattern write aethersense/devices/%u/capabilities
pattern write aethersense/devices/%u/availability
